summary:
  Any picture a song search brings ends the lookup, the way the first
  picture found used to.

history:
  A Deezer row that was the artist with another song was taken like the
  song itself and nothing after it was asked. On 2026-11-12 "Alen Veziko -
  Päiksepoolsel tänaval" wore the sleeve of his single "Nüüd taas sajab
  lund", and a catalogue that had the song would never have been reached.
  Only the song's own cover ends the chain now; anything else waits until
  the last song search has answered. This mutant lets it end the chain.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
                  if (kind === "track" || (kind !== "" && kind === brings)) {

replace:
                  if (kind !== "") {

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artworkengine.qml::test_another_record_at_the_first_request_does_not_keep_the_song_from_being_found.
  Line-neutral.
